  "strategy": "Ghalta, Primal Hunger is a 12/12 trampler that costs {X} less for the total power of your creatures, so the deck ramps with Llanowar Elves, Birds of Paradise, Paradise Druid and Sol Ring into a curve of oversized creatures -- Carnage Tyrant, Gigantosaurus, Regal Imperiosaur, Elder Gargaroth -- that make the commander nearly free. Garruk's Uprising, Elemental Bond and Shamanic Revelation draw off the big bodies, and Overwhelming Stampede turns the board into one lethal trampling swing. Monstrous Onslaught and Ram Through clear blockers with your biggest creature's power, Ezuri's Predation fights their whole board with 4/4 Beasts, and Beast Within, Kenrith's Transformation and Bite Down answer the rest.",
